{
  "title": "Yellow Canadian Lentil Grill",
  "description": "A flavorful and healthy Canadian dish featuring French lentils, perfect for a summer evening, with a grassy and snappy texture, inspired by the monsoon season",
  "cuisine": "Canadian",
  "diet": [
